ORT. THEM. ALL.", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 74}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToUJApLl", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 32, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "yes", "id": 8915741, "raw_content": "", "author": "kek-is-tan", "created": 1793556712645, "profile_picture": "I8XXB1DBtIOB", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Agent_86", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "media.scored.co", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1AToUJApLl.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://media.scored.co/post/m86iN2opVbO6.jpeg", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [{"reference": "/scale/nwJwHaL82AJS5g77.jpeg", "width": 768, "content-type": "jpeg", "height": 761}], "blurhash": "U9PZx{of~qayjqazbIj@~XWU?bs:ogj[ogf8", "full_resolution": [847, 855]}, "title": "We're so back. Feels good man!", "last_comment_created": 1793556831572, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": true, "comments": 1, "score_up": 32, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0YES\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1AToUJApHl", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 32, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8915739, "raw_content": "The timing of the Coup was well thought out.  All Saint's Day when most Government workers are home with loved ones or visiting the graves of their ancestors...and the President is 'Out of Town' on 'State Business'.  They thought everyone would be too distracted to notice until it was too late.\n\nNow rank and file Police are questioning the legality.\n\nThe shit storm was started by a letter dated Oct 29, 2026 from Deputy Chief of Police Tomasz Michu\u0142ka, in which he ordered police officers from prevention departments to be equipped with, among other things, submachine guns...not SOP for this type of action.  Preventive measures to protect demonstrations and protests do not include machine guns according to multiple police experts on these types of actions.\n\nA police union has now formally questioned the legality of the operation and warned that officers might face criminal charges for following superiors' orders...the \"VERY URGENT\" letter dated October 29 \u2014 the day BEFORE the Tribunal move \u2014 from the Deputy Chief of Police  ordering all regional commanders to keep riot units on immediate readiness from November 2\u20138, citing \"the operational situation in the country.\"\n\nNo specific \"operational situation\" was ever identified or substantiated prior to the Coup requiring Riot Police to be on a Readiness Alert.\n\nSo the \"VERY URGENT\" situation was essentially, \"Have everyone standby on full alert.  We're staging a Coup tomorrow...\"\n\nSo yeah \u2014 the Chief Commander of Police is Politically Appointed by the Prime Minster (Tusk), and his chain of command was directly involved in planning the operation.\n\nAn \"unbiased view\" from him would be about as reliable as the Tribunal's own website after it was \"unlawfully taken over.\"\n\nNOTE: Some Links in Polish.  Use Browser translate function on those.\n\nhttps://theconservativetreehouse.com/blog/2026/10/31/alarming-update-on-coup-effort-from-polish-media/\n\nhttps://tvrepublika.pl/Polska/Komendant-glowny-Policji-odpowiada-funkcjonariuszom-wszystko-jest-zgodne-z-prawem/224977\n\nhttps://tvrepublika.pl/Polska/Policja-ma-dosc-Funkcjonariusze-pisza-do-komendanta-glownego/224935\n\nhttps://www.rp.pl/sluzby/art45425741-scisle-tajna-akcja-przejecie-trybunalu-w-policji-wiedzialy-tylko-trzy-osoby\n\nhttps://www.europesays.com/3345614/\n\n\n", "author": "Moebius", "created": 1793556665653, "profile_picture": "0F9hm63l5dUw", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "MIpon2", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Poland SITREP:  The Chief Commander of the Police (Appointed by PM Tusk and Was in on the Planning of the Coup)  Responds to the Police Union 'Police Solidarity': \"Everything is in accordance with the law...\"\n", "last_comment_created": 1793558146800, "content": "<p>The timing of the Coup was well thought out.  All Saint's Day when most Government workers are home with loved ones or visiting the graves of their ancestors...and the President is 'Out of Town' on 'State Business'.  They thought everyone would be too distracted to notice until it was too late.</p>\n<p>Now rank and file Police are questioning the legality.</p>\n<p>The shit storm was started by a letter dated Oct 29, 2026 from Deputy Chief of Police Tomasz Michu\u0142ka, in which he ordered police officers from prevention departments to be equipped with, among other things, submachine guns...not SOP for this type of action.  Preventive measures to protect demonstrations and protests do not include machine guns according to multiple police experts on these types of actions.</p>\n<p>A police union has now formally questioned the legality of the operation and warned that officers might face criminal charges for following superiors' orders...the &quot;VERY URGENT&quot; letter dated October 29 \u2014 the day BEFORE the Tribunal move \u2014 from the Deputy Chief of Police  ordering all regional commanders to keep riot units on immediate readiness from November 2\u20138, citing &quot;the operational situation in the country.&quot;</p>\n<p>No specific &quot;operational situation&quot; was ever identified or substantiated prior to the Coup requiring Riot Police to be on a Readiness Alert.</p>\n<p>So the &quot;VERY URGENT&quot; situation was essentially, &quot;Have everyone standby on full alert.  We're staging a Coup tomorrow...&quot;</p>\n<p>So yeah \u2014 the Chief Commander of Police is Politically Appointed by the Prime Minster (Tusk), and his chain of command was directly involved in planning the operation.</p>\n<p>An &quot;unbiased view&quot; from him would be about as reliable as the Tribunal's own website after it was &quot;unlawfully taken over.&quot;</p>\n<p>NOTE: Some Links in Polish.  Use Browser translate function on those.</p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://theconservativetreehouse.com/blog/2026/10/31/alarming-update-on-coup-effort-from-polish-media/\" target=\"_blank\">https://theconservativetreehouse.com/blog/2026/10/31/alarming-update-on-coup-effort-from-polish-media/</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://tvrepublika.pl/Polska/Komendant-glowny-Policji-odpowiada-funkcjonariuszom-wszystko-jest-zgodne-z-prawem/224977\" target=\"_blank\">https://tvrepublika.pl/Polska/Komendant-glowny-Policji-odpowiada-funkcjonariuszom-wszystko-jest-zgodne-z-prawem/224977</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://tvrepublika.pl/Polska/Policja-ma-dosc-Funkcjonariusze-pisza-do-komendanta-glownego/224935\" target=\"_blank\">https://tvrepublika.pl/Polska/Policja-ma-dosc-Funkcjonariusze-pisza-do-komendanta-glownego/224935</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.rp.pl/sluzby/art45425741-scisle-tajna-akcja-przejecie-trybunalu-w-policji-wiedzialy-tylko-trzy-osoby\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.rp.pl/sluzby/art45425741-scisle-tajna-akcja-przejecie-trybunalu-w-policji-wiedzialy-tylko-trzy-osoby</a></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.europesays.com/3345614/\" target=\"